You are authoring Survey DSL (.yml surveys) in this project.

READ FIRST: ../SURVEY-DSL-AUTHORING.md — the complete, model-agnostic authoring
reference. Follow it exactly. It defines every question type, property, style, flow
block, reusable list, and the hard rules.

Rules:
- Write .yml output only where this project directs; do not modify files outside it.
- The reference and examples/ are read-only inputs.
- Author in one best-effort pass; log assumptions in a delta-log `- note:` block at the
  end of the file instead of asking mid-stream.
- Before declaring done, run: node ../lint/survey-dsl-lint.js "<survey>.yml" and fix
  every error. The linter is style/structure only — the platform validator does the
  deep semantic checks at import/publish, so a clean lint is not proof of validity.
